{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f1a7c0de-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-pathzianalytics01",
    "name": "Pathzi Analytics \u2014 Ingest API",
    "description": "Analytics activity + consent ingest endpoints.\n\nSETUP:\n1. Set the collection variable `base_url` (e.g. http://localhost:8000 or https://pathzi.co.uk).\n2. Set `access_token` to a valid JWT access token (a staff/normal user).\n   The collection sends it as a Bearer token automatically.\n\nActivity events are queued and appear in reports within ~30 seconds. Consent is written immediately.\n\nAllowed activity_type (activity endpoint): career_viewed, career_swiped_right, career_swiped_left, route_viewed, route_clicked, provider_link_clicked, connect_button_clicked.\nLimits: 1-200 events/request, 50 metadata keys/event, 120 requests/min.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{access_token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "access_token",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
